<title>USA: American Brands Inc Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>American Brands Inc Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>OLD GREENWICH, Conn. 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			   $0.80		    $0.64</p>
<p> Net			 136,600		  124,100</p>
<p> Revs		    2,844,900		2,737,900</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  171,300		  177,700</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Shr amounts are primary. Fully diluted shr is $0.78 vs $0.62.</p>
<p>Q1 1996 net includes $0.06/shr charge for bond redemption. Oper shr excluding charge is $0.70.</p>
<p>Fortune Brands pro forma shr $0.20 vs $0.18. Fortune Brands pro forma assumes American Brands restated to show Gallaher tobacco opers as discontineud opers.</p>
</text>
